<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Quill Communications — Proposal for Avora Real Estate</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --orange:#FF9729;
    --orange-deep:#E27E12;
    --ink:#1c1c1c;
    --ink-soft:#6b6b6b;
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --paper-2:#faf7f2;
    --line:#ececec;
    --accent-bg:#ffffff;
    --accent-fg:#1c1c1c;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
    padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
  }
  html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink);
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.55;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:780px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 64px;}

  header.brand{
    background:var(--accent-bg); color:var(--accent-fg);
    padding:44px 24px 36px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  header.brand .inner{max-width:780px; margin:0 auto;}
  header.brand img.logo{height:34px; width:auto; display:block; margin-bottom:30px;}
  header.brand h1{
    font-size:26px; margin:0 0 8px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.3;
  }
  header.brand .sub{
    color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px; margin:0;
  }

  .meta{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px; margin:28px 0 8px;
    font-size:13px;
  }
  .meta div span.label{display:block; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:3px;}

  section{padding:32px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  section:last-of-type{border-bottom:none;}
  h2{
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; font-size:13px; color:var(--orange-deep);
    margin:0 0 20px; font-weight:800;
  }
  .intro p{font-size:16px; color:var(--ink); max-width:66ch;}

  .service{
    display:flex; gap:16px; padding:16px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .service:first-of-type{border-top:none; padding-top:0;}
  .service .num{
    color:var(--orange); font-size:13px; font-weight:800; width:22px; flex-shrink:0; padding-top:3px;
  }
  .service h3{margin:0 0 4px; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;}
  .service p{margin:0; font-size:14.5px; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  table.rhythm{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13.5px; margin-top:4px;}
  table.rhythm th{
    text-align:left; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; font-size:10.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft); padding:0 10px 10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  table.rhythm td{
    padding:12px 10px 12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:top;
  }
  table.rhythm td.week{color:var(--orange-deep); font-weight:700; white-space:nowrap;}
  table.rhythm tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}

  .pricing-single{
    background:var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px;
    padding:28px; text-align:center; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .pricing-single::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:4px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--orange));
  }
  .pricing-single .tag{
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:10px; font-weight:700;
  }
  .pricing-single .amount{font-size:34px; color:var(--orange-deep); font-weight:800; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .pricing-single .amount sup{font-size:13px; font-weight:500; margin-left:4px; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .pricing-single .note{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  .terms{
    font-size:14px; color:var(--ink); background:var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px; padding:16px 20px; margin-top:16px;
  }
  .terms strong{color:var(--orange-deep);}
  .terms + .terms{margin-top:12px;}

  .steps{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; counter-reset:step;}
  .steps li{
    counter-increment:step; display:flex; gap:14px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:14.5px;
  }
  .steps li:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .steps li::before{
    content:counter(step);
    background:var(--orange); color:#1c1c1c; font-weight:800; font-size:12px;
    width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }

  footer{
    background:var(--accent-bg); color:var(--ink-soft); padding:28px 24px;
    font-size:12.5px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  footer .inner{max-width:780px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; align-items:center;}
  footer .orange{color:var(--orange);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="brand">
  <div class="inner">
    <img class="logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Quill">
    <h1>Digital Marketing Strategy &amp; Execution Proposal</h1>
    <p class="sub">Prepared for Avora Real Estate — brand authority, demand generation &amp; sales conversion</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="meta">
    <div><span class="label">Prepared for</span>Avora Real Estate</div>
    <div><span class="label">Prepared by</span>Quill Communications</div>
    <div><span class="label">Date</span>25 September 2026</div>
    <div><span class="label">Validity</span>30 days from issue</div>
  </div>

  <section class="intro">
    <p>Avora sits at the intersection of premium living and serious investment — a positioning that deserves a marketing engine built with the same precision. This proposal outlines a full-scale content, advertising, and community program engineered to build Avora into a recognized, trusted name in Addis Ababa's real estate market, while driving qualified inquiries for both Block A and Block B.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Scope of Services</h2>

    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">01</div>
      <div><h3>Content Creation</h3><p>A monthly content matrix balancing reach, authority, and conversion — built around Avora's story, amenities, and buyer journey.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">02</div>
      <div><h3>Video Production — 3 Shoot Days Monthly</h3><p>Dedicated on-location production days to capture the property, amenities, and talent-led content that fuels the monthly matrix.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <div><h3>Social Media Management</h3><p>End-to-end management of Avora's social presence — planning, scheduling, posting, and day-to-day account oversight.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">04</div>
      <div><h3>Community Management</h3><p>Active monitoring and response across comments, DMs, and inquiries — keeping prospective buyers engaged and moving toward conversion.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">05</div>
      <div><h3>Paid Advertising</h3><p>Planning, launching, and optimizing campaigns across Meta, TikTok, and Telegram to sustain visibility among active property seekers. <em>Ad spend funded directly by Avora Real Estate.</em></p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">06</div>
      <div><h3>Influencer Marketing</h3><p>Sourcing, vetting, negotiating, and directing local influencer partnerships on Avora's behalf, from outreach through final content delivery. <em>Influencer fees funded directly by Avora Real Estate.</em></p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <div class="num">07</div>
      <div><h3>Graphic Design</h3><p>High-fidelity static creative for paid and organic use — pricing breakdowns, floor plans, and campaign visuals built to convert at a glance.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Monthly Campaign Rhythm</h2>
    <table class="rhythm">
      <tr><th>Phase</th><th>Focus</th><th>Objective</th></tr>
      <tr><td class="week">Week 1</td><td>Awareness &amp; Hype</td><td>Generate mass reach and drive profile visits.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="week">Week 2</td><td>Authority Building</td><td>Position Avora as a premium, trustworthy developer.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="week">Week 3</td><td>Product Showcase</td><td>Spotlight Block A &amp; B specs, pricing, and location.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="week">Week 4</td><td>Conversion Push</td><td>Drive direct inquiries, messages, and site visits.</td></tr>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Investment</h2>
    <div class="pricing-single">
      <div class="tag">Monthly Retainer</div>
      <div class="amount">110,000<sup>ETB / mo</sup></div>
      <div class="note">Excluding VAT</div>
    </div>
    <div class="terms">The retainer covers strategy, production, management, and creative execution across all seven scope items above.</div>
    <div class="terms"><strong>Paid ad spend and influencer fees are budgeted and funded separately by Avora Real Estate</strong> — Quill manages and optimizes these on your behalf, but the underlying budgets sit outside the retainer.</div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Next Steps, Once You're In</h2>
    <ul class="steps">
      <li>A dedicated project manager is assigned as your direct point of contact for all needs and requests.</li>
      <li>Content and materials for each shoot are due 2 days before the scheduled production day.</li>
      <li>We build a tailored monthly campaign calendar aligned to the weekly rhythm above.</li>
      <li>We sign a 3-month contract to kick things off, with ad and influencer budgets confirmed at signing.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

</div>

<footer>
  <div class="inner">
    <span>Quill Communications</span>
    <span class="orange">quillcommunications.online</span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
